DESCRIPTION:Davis Sings Together is a FREE community singalong for EVERYONE. No experience needed\, just show up and have fun!\nAll ages welcome. Come sing with us!\nSupported\, in part\, by a grant from the City of Davis Arts & Cultural Affairs program. Thank you @cityofdavisarts for helping bring the Davis community together through singing!
