SUMMARY:United Against Hate Week
DESCRIPTION:United Against Hate Week is an annual seven-day campaign of local civic action designed to stop hate\, bigotry and implicit biases that threaten the safety and civility of neighborhoods\, towns\, and cities. To learn more and see how your community can join\, visit: https://www.unitedagainsthateweek.org/. 
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/united-against-hate-week-2/
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
