SUMMARY:Principles of Community Celebration
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 Principles of Community Celebration recognizes the people and partnerships that bring our values to life across UC Davis. \nThe celebration will feature recognition of the Soaring to New Heights and ASUCD awards honorees\, stories from faculty\, staff and students\, showcases highlighting community-engaged research and partnerships\, and opportunities to connect with colleagues and community partners. \n  \nWe honor our collective decision to be part of this community\, and we celebrate the ongoing work of making UC Davis a place people want to be. \nFor more information\, visit: https://excellence.ucdavis.edu/events/principles-community-celebration.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/principles-of-community-celebration/
LOCATION:UC Davis ARC\, 760 Orchard Road\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/Principles-of-Community-Celebration-2026.png
